	"name": "Skullcracker",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/control/debuff-energy-hold-levitate-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With a sharp twist and a fast impact with the nearest object, you discombobulate your target. As part of your attack action, you may force your target to make a Strength or Dexterity saving throw, your choice. On a failure, the target takes Basic Melee damage and is blinded or deafened for a number of rounds equal to your proficiency modifier as you slam their head into the environment. They may make a Constitution save at the end of each of their turns to end this effect.</p>",
